    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "76c5e310d6734121b7a5cd542ed2e325",
    "m_Title": "Rather than seeing if the difference is greater than a certain threshold:",
    "m_Content": "We check if the two values are above or below an angle threshold. If higher angle is above floor threshold, but lower angle is below it, we need to show an edge.\nIf our angle is the higher angle, show red.\nIf the different one is higher (meaning ours is lower) show blue",
    "m_TextSize": 0,
    "m_Theme": 0,
